5. Thread J's class W: is each query 'a point query on about n/(D+1) candidate windows'?
==============================================================================
  Theorem J1: s = ceil((sigma+1)/(D+1)), N = n - s(D+1) + 1, load l >= N/s.
  The effective number of candidates is N/s ~ Lambda = min{n, (D+1)n/(sigma+1)},
  not n/(D+1).
     n sigma   D    s     N      N/s   Lambda  n/(D+1)
